      "completeness": 5,
      "style_fit": 5
    },
    "notes": "Inspected all 12 views including a full-size front orbit. Range dial legends, the V/mA/kOhm scale, buttons, terminals and the rear schematic label are all sharp and legible at 2k. Test leads are modelled as swept geometry with proper plug bodies and metal probes, and they read correctly from top and bottom. Four texture maps including the printed panels.",
    "limitations": [
      "The analogue needle sits behind a dark tinted window and is hard to read at gallery scale.",
      "Leads are in a fixed coiled pose."
    ],
